  "result": {
    "summary": "Verified full diff against HEAD~1 in wt/T-0989. is_goal(t) guard is applied consistently in daemon.dispatch/gate/merge_reviewed/auto_fix_round/reconcile_dead/stale, matching the spec's container semantics; stale() short-circuits goal tasks and the notify is process-global as specified. executor.start/reply and spawn.run_worker refuse goal containers without mutating task status, matching test_start_refuses_goal_container's assertion that status stays queued. planner_runs.decision_points now admits parentless execute-role goal containers into the closable/held/scouts_done checks alongside triage-role goals, which is required for closable to ever fire for the new execute-role goal shape; children_by_parent/executes/merged_into logic is unchanged and generic, so this doesn't disturb existing triage-goal behavior. All five acceptance tests match the code paths they assert against. docs/orchestrator-goals.md is 15 lines (under the 40-line cap) and contains the required revert note. No correctness defects found.",
